# Enforce LF line endings for all text files across platforms.
# Biome's formatter is configured with `lineEnding: "lf"` (biome.json) and
# Windows clones with `core.autocrlf=true` would otherwise materialize the
# checkout as CRLF and fail every formatter check.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Lockfiles and binary artifacts: untouched.
*.lockb binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.sqlite binary
*.sqlite-* binary
